WEBVTT

1
00:03:16.417 --> 00:03:18.909
Where is everyone?

2
00:06:18.792 --> 00:06:20.954
Six bulls and one single matador:

3
00:06:21.167 --> 00:06:22.248
Antonio Villalta.

4
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:46.996
To you, and to the child
we are expecting!

5
00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:13.620
This Carmen is so lucky! A bullfighter
for a husband. So handsome and SO RICH.

6
00:13:19.583 --> 00:13:22.997
Carmen de Triana, the wife
of Antonio Villalta, is dead!

7
00:14:31.083 --> 00:14:32.995
Where is Carmen?

8
00:14:44.875 --> 00:14:47.868
I can't feel my hands...
or my feet!

9
00:14:55.375 --> 00:14:57.617
Where is Carmen?

10
00:17:27.833 --> 00:17:30.075
GENTLEMEN, PLEASE!!

11
00:17:35.792 --> 00:17:38.284
Señor Antonio Villalta
is in recovery...

12
00:17:47.833 --> 00:17:50.792
...he will answer your questions
in due time.

13
00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:43.866
CARMENCITA!!

14
00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:04.162
Olé, Pepe!!

15
00:19:56.208 --> 00:19:59.747
Do you think Father will come
to my communion tomorrow?

16
00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.243
Antonio Villalta gravely gored

17
00:20:52.292 --> 00:20:54.784
GRAND WEDDING IN SEVILLE

18
00:21:24.167 --> 00:21:26.705
Please, Lord Jesus,
I'd like to see my father.

19
00:22:49.208 --> 00:22:51.666
A gift from your father.

20
00:28:00.250 --> 00:28:02.663
Welcome to your new home, dear!

21
00:28:42.542 --> 00:28:45.910
The second floor
is absolutely off limits to you!

22
00:29:06.458 --> 00:29:08.324
TO THE CHICKEN COOP!

23
00:29:27.167 --> 00:29:30.410
Don't you like your room?
It's very cozy.

24
00:30:32.542 --> 00:30:33.749
Carmencita had to do

25
00:30:33.917 --> 00:30:36.000
the toughest jobs on the property.

26
00:31:04.750 --> 00:31:07.083
Take this to Don Antonio!

27
00:31:51.292 --> 00:31:53.204
CCCK-A-DOODLE-DOOOO!!!

28
00:32:09.958 --> 00:32:11.995
Pepe, stay right there!

29
00:32:51.625 --> 00:32:53.867
Where has Pepe gone?

30
00:37:19.250 --> 00:37:20.866
I'm thirsty.

31
00:37:51.167 --> 00:37:53.204
The next day...

32
00:38:43.750 --> 00:38:46.868
Come closer. I won't bite you!

33
00:39:08.917 --> 00:39:10.783
Don't cry, Father.

34
00:39:15.708 --> 00:39:18.166
They're tears of joy.

35
00:39:29.167 --> 00:39:31.580
Forgive me, my darling.

36
00:39:39.375 --> 00:39:43.198
- Longing for the past is like chasing
after the wind. Russian Proverb.

37
00:39:52.333 --> 00:39:55.451
Grandma, Grandma,
what a big mouth you have...

38
00:41:21.417 --> 00:41:23.283
Lower your hands!

39
00:42:45.917 --> 00:42:48.330
Never take your eyes off the bull.

40
00:43:22.750 --> 00:43:24.742
CLOSE YOUR EYES!

41
00:46:13.917 --> 00:46:15.783
That evening, for the first time ever,

42
00:46:15.958 --> 00:46:17.199
Encarna invited Carmencita

43
00:46:17.375 --> 00:46:18.286
to dine with her.

44
00:47:05.708 --> 00:47:08.121
Do you like PEPE-ry chicken?

45
00:47:16.292 --> 00:47:18.830
I'm sorry...
I meant to say, peppery.

46
00:48:07.208 --> 00:48:11.077
If you disobey me again,
you know who will be next!

47
00:51:20.625 --> 00:51:21.866
SMILE!!

48
00:52:02.792 --> 00:52:04.624
NEXT!!

49
00:52:52.750 --> 00:52:54.582
SMILE!!

50
00:53:40.208 --> 00:53:42.074
The following day, Carmen's stepmother

51
00:53:42.208 --> 00:53:43.449
sent her to gather flowers

52
00:53:43.625 --> 00:53:44.741
for her father's grave.

53
00:53:44.917 --> 00:53:46.203
Far, so very far away...

54
00:56:06.208 --> 00:56:08.120
At nightfall...

55
00:56:59.208 --> 00:57:00.915
What's your name?

56
00:57:09.500 --> 00:57:12.368
What happened to you?
You have marks on your neck.

57
00:57:24.458 --> 00:57:27.530
She's going to bring us trouble!
And worse, she's in my bed...

58
00:57:29.375 --> 00:57:31.207
AND IN OURS!

59
00:57:33.083 --> 00:57:34.995
We can't leave her like this...

60
00:57:37.208 --> 00:57:39.575
She's just a young girl!

61
00:57:42.667 --> 00:57:44.283
Who are all of you?

62
00:57:51.083 --> 00:57:54.656
The Bullfighting Dwarves

63
00:58:11.000 --> 00:58:13.287
Just you wait and see
the trouble she brings!

64
01:01:40.250 --> 01:01:42.162
ISN'T ANYONE
GOING TO DO ANYTHING?!

65
01:01:44.292 --> 01:01:46.705
The crowd loves it!

66
01:03:38.167 --> 01:03:40.500
Where did you learn how to bullfight?

67
01:03:45.792 --> 01:03:47.499
I don't know...

68
01:03:50.083 --> 01:03:52.666
Would you like to stay with us?

69
01:03:59.458 --> 01:04:02.121
You still don't remember your name?

70
01:04:08.958 --> 01:04:12.201
We'll call you <i>Snowhite,</i>
like the girl in the tale.

71
01:05:27.750 --> 01:05:29.912
SNOWHITE
AND THE 7 BULLFIGHTING DWARVES

72
01:06:37.208 --> 01:06:38.949
I don't know how to read.

73
01:06:45.542 --> 01:06:48.285
I'm Carlos Montoya,
bullfighting agent.

74
01:06:59.208 --> 01:07:00.915
Would you like to...

75
01:07:05.875 --> 01:07:07.707
Would you all like to...

76
01:07:10.833 --> 01:07:14.372
... debut your show at La Colosal
bullfighting ring in Seville?

77
01:07:30.708 --> 01:07:33.121
CONTRACT BETWEEN...

78
01:07:33.250 --> 01:07:36.994
... EXCLUSIVELY...

79
01:07:37.208 --> 01:07:41.202
... FOR THE REST OF HER LIFE...

80
01:07:53.667 --> 01:07:55.624
It's strictly a formality.

81
01:08:30.333 --> 01:08:32.245
Meanwhile, Encarna shows her new house

82
01:08:32.417 --> 01:08:34.374
in Seville to the magazine <i>Lecturas.</i>

83
01:08:50.458 --> 01:08:52.495
How are you coping
with the loss of your husband

84
01:08:52.667 --> 01:08:54.283
on this first anniversary
of his death?

85
01:08:58.583 --> 01:09:00.791
It's a cross I must bear.

86
01:09:13.250 --> 01:09:15.993
Let me introduce Genaro Bilbao,
my decorator.

87
01:09:28.542 --> 01:09:31.376
- So, I'll be on the cover?
- Of course!

88
01:13:31.958 --> 01:13:33.449
SNOWHITE IS AN ARTFUL BULLFIGHTER.

89
01:13:33.625 --> 01:13:36.117
ACCOMPANIED BY HER DWARVES,
SHE IS FILLING UP RINGS...

90
01:13:39.167 --> 01:13:42.911
The art of bullfighting
runs in my veins.

91
01:13:50.875 --> 01:13:54.448
Smiling, Encarna poses
in her new home.

92
01:15:05.083 --> 01:15:09.532
NEXT APRIL 21st SHE WILL PERFORM
IN LA COLOSAL IN SEVILLE

93
01:15:31.417 --> 01:15:33.875
SOLD OUT

94
01:16:42.417 --> 01:16:45.831
BULL: SATAN
BULLFIGHTER: LAGARTIJO WEIGHT: 536 Kg.

95
01:17:02.458 --> 01:17:05.622
BULL: FERDINAND
BULLFIGHTER: SNOWHITE WEIGHT: 140 Kg.

96
01:17:12.833 --> 01:17:16.452
Thank you, from the bottom of my heart,
for everything you've done for me.

97
01:17:19.792 --> 01:17:21.784
You're my family.

98
01:17:48.583 --> 01:17:50.074
WHAT ABOUT ME...?

99
01:17:53.292 --> 01:17:55.750
... No kiss for me?

100
01:18:36.083 --> 01:18:38.496
Carmen, I knew it was you!

101
01:18:49.250 --> 01:18:52.823
Today, Antonio Villalta
would be proud of his daughter.

102
01:21:06.125 --> 01:21:08.788
WHO SWITCHED
THE CALF FOR A BULL?

103
01:21:54.583 --> 01:21:56.666
Never take your eyes off the bull

104
01:22:54.333 --> 01:22:57.121
LET IT GO!
YOU'RE RISKING YOUR LIFE!

105
01:23:00.250 --> 01:23:03.209
I have to continue the <i>faena,</i>
for my father...

106
01:23:05.375 --> 01:23:07.207
...ANTONIO VILLALTA.

107
01:23:28.500 --> 01:23:31.288
That's Antonio Villalta's daughter...

108
01:24:25.542 --> 01:24:26.282
It is the climax,

109
01:24:26.458 --> 01:24:27.744
but everything that begins

110
01:24:27.917 --> 01:24:28.873
must come to an end.

111
01:25:20.458 --> 01:25:22.745
They're asking
for the bull to be pardoned.

112
01:27:18.583 --> 01:27:20.575
Be more careful, Tom Thumb!

113
01:28:06.250 --> 01:28:08.287
THIS WAS YOUR FATHER'S <i>MON TERA!</i>

114
01:29:52.542 --> 01:29:54.329
SHE'S DEAD!!

115
01:33:34.833 --> 01:33:39.783
FREAK SHOW
SNOWHITE'S AWAKENING

116
01:33:59.208 --> 01:34:01.245
A big applause for Pudding Pie!

117
01:34:20.583 --> 01:34:22.791
A miracle or a curse?

118
01:34:30.917 --> 01:34:32.829
A MIRACLE OR A CURSE?

119
01:34:45.833 --> 01:34:47.745
A MIRACLE OR A CURSE?

120
01:35:14.667 --> 01:35:17.375
Will Snowhite awaken
from her eternal sleep?

121
01:35:33.417 --> 01:35:37.707
For just 10 cents more, you can try
your luck and kiss the famous...

122
01:35:44.583 --> 01:35:46.575
SNOWHITE!!!

123
01:37:25.625 --> 01:37:27.287
A MIRACLE!!
